<title>GERMANY: Munich air cargo rises 21pct in March, Q1 up 19pct.</title>
<headline>Munich air cargo rises 21pct in March, Q1 up 19pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total air cargo flown to and from Munich airport (MUC) in March rose strongly by 21 percent year-on-year to 8,715 tonnes, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>Details in tonnes of cargo handled at Munich airport in March and for the year to date and with year-on-year percentage changes include:</p>
<p>		     March   Pct	 Jan-Mar   Pct</p>
<p>    Total cargo  8,715  Up 21.0    23,173   Up 19.1</p>
<p>    Exports	4,165  Up 35.5    10,757   Up 25.7</p>
<p>    Imports	3,852  Up 11.4    10,288   Up 12.5</p>
<p>    Transit	  698  Up  3.6     2,128   Up 21.5</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Muenchen GmbH market research dept. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax 5017</p>
</text>
